{"name": "HeXpunk", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a town devastated by ManaCore, there\u2019s a reactor left running out of control, summoning creatures from worlds beyond. You play as one of two punks on a mission to shut down the reactor, bringing peace to the area and sticking it to ManaCore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Characters</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hemlock:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras_big/5871049d3b270267b5abd79f94c4d4f9.avif?t=1750218273\" height=\"416\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/5871049d3b270267b5abd79f94c4d4f9.avif?t=1750218273\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic Magic Attack:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rapid Fire: Shots that deal poison damage in quick succession.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/294688a5d888a68c6196ee1ff70d0fb1.poster.avif?t=1750218273\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/294688a5d888a68c6196ee1ff70d0fb1.webm?t=1750218273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/294688a5d888a68c6196ee1ff70d0fb1.mp4?t=1750218273\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special Abilities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vortex: Summon a sphere that clumps enemies together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/866ec55c09e2485d232a2d21a2ebde3b.poster.avif?t=1750218273\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/866ec55c09e2485d232a2d21a2ebde3b.webm?t=1750218273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/866ec55c09e2485d232a2d21a2ebde3b.mp4?t=1750218273\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acid Bomb: Rain down acid from above with a massive bomb.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/7d1d3476e3b952e90239774c22679cc6.poster.avif?t=1750218273\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/7d1d3476e3b952e90239774c22679cc6.webm?t=1750218273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/7d1d3476e3b952e90239774c22679cc6.mp4?t=1750218273\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Faraday:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras_big/ffe3636c8d460f86f5cc625c1d202e31.avif?t=1750218273\" height=\"404\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632680/extras/ffe3636c8d460f86f5cc625c1d202e31.avif?t=1750218273\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic Magic Attack:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread Fire: Shots that c